  "title": "http: fix UTF-8 handling in expert info for status code token",
  "description": "Fix UTF-8 handling in HTTP expert info for malformed status code tokens.\n\nReplace \"%.\\*s\" with format_text() to ensure safe handling of non-UTF-8 or non-printable input, as reported by fuzz testing.\n\nThis prevents invalid UTF-8 from reaching proto_tree_set_representation() and aligns with Wireshark string handling conventions.",
